                                <p><p><strong><u>Jaise pinjre me ho panchi</u></strong></p>

<p>Sabr kaise ho rehano sarwar, hum to aaye he khud shaam ho kar, aaj bhi shaam dhalti he jab bhi, ek sadaa kaat thi he kaleja, aawo baba jaan.</p>

