<ol>
 <li>Kabhi amaa ke pehlu me rona, kabhi bhaiya se apne lipat na. Kabhi takrana diwaro darse kabhi zindaa ke darpe ye kehna. Aawo baba jaan.</li>
 <li>Aise takra ti phir ti thi bachi (Jese pinjre me zakhmi ho panchi) x2 kaise tare kafus tor dale, ho rihaai ka koi kareena. Aawo baba jaan.</li>
 <li>Mot-e se pehle ajaawo baba (Ye sakina pe ehsaan hoga) x2 baad mere na baba ye kehna mene tumko pukaara nahi tha. Aawo baba jaan.</li>
 <li>Ae phuphi ab mera dil he kehta (Mujko miljayenga mera baba) x2 Dadi zehra ki mano kahaani, milgaya tha suna ran ka beta. Aawo baba jaan.</li>
 <li>Hogayi khair-e aayaa na Asghar (Wo to marjataa zindaa me gutkar) x2 Kaise sota andhere me bhaiya, qaid-e hojataa zindaa me jule. Aawo baba jaan.</li>
 <li>Haye khun me bhara sar jo ayaa (baap ke sarse beti ne pucha) x2 Mu pe mu rakh ke sona sakungi, he kaha mere baba ke sina. Aawo baba jaan.</li>
</ol>

